{"id":12263,"author":"Kammeh","body":"It has been a very long time since I have done an AMA. This will be the first one I'm doing after getting Moderator.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI feel as though not too much of the community knows me too well, so I decided to make it possible for player to learn more about me, and who I am, as well as what my intentions are. I sometimes feel detached from people, and would love to fill that void with friendship and camaraderie. Hopefully I will be able to take benefit from this post and also learn a little more about the community, and become the best person possible. Feel free to ask questions, just make them a little relevant and so you can actually learn something that is worth knowing about me. Also, please do not ask questions that are too personal (use self judgement).\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI look forward to answering all your questions!\u003cbr\u003eYour friend, Frustration (kammy878)","body_tagged":"It has been a very long time since I have done an AMA. This will be the first one I'm doing after getting Moderator.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI feel as though not too much of the community knows me too well, so I decided to make it possible for player to learn more about me, and who I am, as well as what my intentions are. I sometimes feel detached from people, and would love to fill that void with friendship and camaraderie. Hopefully I will be able to take benefit from this post and also learn a little more about the community, and become the best person possible. Feel free to ask questions, just make them a little relevant and so you can actually learn something that is worth knowing about me. Also, please do not ask questions that are too personal (use self judgement).\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI look forward to answering all your questions!\u003cbr\u003eYour friend, Frustration (kammy878)","created_at":1428207509,"title":"Frustration's AMA [Please Read OP] :D","replies":[{"id":172488,"author":"CozzehPvP_","body":"will you marry me?","body_tagged":"will you marry me?","created_at":1428207526},{"id":172489,"author":"JJTheGuy","body":"Charmy 4 life?","body_tagged":"Charmy 4 life?","created_at":1428208066},{"id":172494,"author":"Kammeh","body":"Please refer to the OP and post questions that others may find useful as well. I'll still answer though :P \u003cbr\u003eHmm.. let's see, I have some conditions. Do you get easily frustrated, because I need someone who isn't so there will be an equal balance in the world, else the illuminati will turn in to a square and the world will turn into minecraft. Along with that, we will all get blown up by kreepers. But for real though, do you have \u0026nbsp;enuf \u0026nbsp;sweg \u0026nbsp;5 me or naw? Because if not, spoderman will 10 hart me.","body_tagged":"Please refer to the OP and post questions that others may find useful as well. I'll still answer though :P \u003cbr\u003eHmm.. let's see, I have some conditions. Do you get easily frustrated, because I need someone who isn't so there will be an equal balance in the world, else the illuminati will turn in to a square and the world will turn into minecraft. Along with that, we will all get blown up by kreepers. But for real though, do you have \u0026nbsp;enuf \u0026nbsp;sweg \u0026nbsp;5 me or naw? Because if not, spoderman will 10 hart me.","created_at":1428208394},{"id":172495,"author":"Kammeh","body":"JJ, I might change my skin soon though. But then I'll be known by something else, as I don't change my skin often, but so far, am Charmy5life.","body_tagged":"JJ, I might change my skin soon though. But then I'll be known by something else, as I don't change my skin often, but so far, am Charmy5life.","created_at":1428208521},{"id":172497,"author":"Lavish","body":"Am I your favorite?","body_tagged":"Am I your favorite?","created_at":1428209467},{"id":172498,"author":"Kammeh","body":"Yes, ily. My Homie Gee. But in all honesty, when I was promoted to Jr. Mod, you were the support that I needed, and you really helped me on my journey. Also, you were a great inspiration and have cheered me up when I was sad, as\u0026nbsp;well as pushed me forward to strive to reach my goals. Thanks Cal, ily :D \u0026lt;3","body_tagged":"Yes, ily. My Homie Gee. But in all honesty, when I was promoted to Jr. Mod, you were the support that I needed, and you really helped me on my journey. Also, you were a great inspiration and have cheered me up when I was sad, as\u0026nbsp;well as pushed me forward to strive to reach my goals. Thanks Cal, ily :D \u0026lt;3","created_at":1428210136},{"id":172655,"author":"NuclearDucky","body":"best friend?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edo you want to apply for Sr some day?","body_tagged":"best friend?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edo you want to apply for Sr some day?","created_at":1428240689},{"id":172656,"author":"Milki","body":"Kentucky Fried Charmy? Plzplzplzplzplz\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow many licks to the center of a lollipop?","body_tagged":"Kentucky Fried Charmy? Plzplzplzplzplz\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow many licks to the center of a lollipop?","created_at":1428240900},{"id":173737,"author":"Kammeh","body":"\u003cp\u003e@Nuclear Yes Ily \u0026lt;3 Everyone is my best friend :D\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso, yes, eventually I will aspire to become a Sr. Moderator. At this time though, I still have plenty of time and mistakes to go through before I'm ready to hold such a role. :P\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e@Milki Bruhh.... I have illoominati on my side, and they don't like to eat or fry Kentucky Fried Charmanders. They despise that, and will send out the OICK (Official Iloominati Kool Kids) To\u0026nbsp;deter\u0026nbsp;those against the Charmanders. One thing I do love though is Nebraska frozen Milk Cream (Ice cream) :D Yumm =D\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd yes, it takes three licks to get to the center of a tootsie pop, because iloominati invented it, and they are all about the\u0026nbsp;\"three\" (For example, YOLO doesn't apply to them, they don't only live once, they only live thrice)\u0026nbsp;life, so obviously, the answer is three licks. (Also, you have to lick in the shape of a triangle, trust me, it works :c )\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp\u003e@Nuclear Yes Ily \u0026lt;3 Everyone is my best friend :D\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso, yes, eventually I will aspire to become a Sr. Moderator. At this time though, I still have plenty of time and mistakes to go through before I'm ready to hold such a role. :P\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e@Milki Bruhh.... I have illoominati on my side, and they don't like to eat or fry Kentucky Fried Charmanders. They despise that, and will send out the OICK (Official Iloominati Kool Kids) To\u0026nbsp;deter\u0026nbsp;those against the Charmanders. One thing I do love though is Nebraska frozen Milk Cream (Ice cream) :D Yumm =D\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd yes, it takes three licks to get to the center of a tootsie pop, because iloominati invented it, and they are all about the\u0026nbsp;\"three\" (For example, YOLO doesn't apply to them, they don't only live once, they only live thrice)\u0026nbsp;life, so obviously, the answer is three licks. (Also, you have to lick in the shape of a triangle, trust me, it works :c )\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1428445672},{"id":174128,"author":"Kammeh","body":"Bump (Please don't hate, I just don't want to make another thread) ^_^","body_tagged":"Bump (Please don't hate, I just don't want to make another thread) ^_^","created_at":1428526479},{"id":174129,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003eSorry if this is super long Kammy xD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1) Whats your (full) name?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e2) How old are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e3) Whats your Birthday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e4) What starsign does that make it?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e5) Whats your favourite colour?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e6) Whats your lucky number?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e7) Do you have any pets?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e8) Where are you from?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e9) How tall are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e10) What shoe size are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e11) How many pairs of shoes do you own?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e12) If you were prime miniser/ruler of the world what laws would you make?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e13) If you were a super hero what powers would you have?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e14) and what would your hero name be?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e15) and what outfit would you wear?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e16) What was your last dream about?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e17) What would you do if you won the lottery?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e18) Would you like to build/design your own house?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e19) Which form of public transport do you prefer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e20) What talents do you have?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e21) Can you juggle?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e22) Can you solve a rubix cube?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e23) Do you have a cherished childhood teddybear?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e24) Are you psychic in any way?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e25) Are you a good dancer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e26) Are you a good singer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e27) Are you a good cook?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e28) Are you a good artist?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e29) Are you a good listener?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e30) Are you a good public speaker?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e31) Are you a good babysitter?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e32) Are you a good mechanic?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e33) Are you a good diplomat?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e34) Are you a good employee?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e35) Are you a good dresser?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e36) Are you a good swimmer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e37) Are you a good skier?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e38) Are you a good lover?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e39) Are you a good musician?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e40) Are you a good comedian?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e41) Are you a good cleaner?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e42) Are you a good actor?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e43) Are you a good writer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e44) Have you ever been bungee jumping?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e45) Have you ever been canoeing/kayaking?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e46) What types of holidays do you prefer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e47) Whats the furthest you've ever been on holiday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e48) What was your favourite holiday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e49) Where would your dream holiday be?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e50) Can you tap dance?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e51) Whats your favourite zoo animal?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e52) Whats your favourite sport?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e53) Whats your favourite food?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e54) Whats your favourite pizza topping?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: Removed 46 of them ;p\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003eSorry if this is super long Kammy xD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1) Whats your (full) name?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e2) How old are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e3) Whats your Birthday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e4) What starsign does that make it?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e5) Whats your favourite colour?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e6) Whats your lucky number?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e7) Do you have any pets?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e8) Where are you from?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e9) How tall are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e10) What shoe size are you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e11) How many pairs of shoes do you own?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e12) If you were prime miniser/ruler of the world what laws would you make?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e13) If you were a super hero what powers would you have?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e14) and what would your hero name be?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e15) and what outfit would you wear?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e16) What was your last dream about?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e17) What would you do if you won the lottery?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e18) Would you like to build/design your own house?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e19) Which form of public transport do you prefer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e20) What talents do you have?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e21) Can you juggle?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e22) Can you solve a rubix cube?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e23) Do you have a cherished childhood teddybear?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e24) Are you psychic in any way?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e25) Are you a good dancer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e26) Are you a good singer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e27) Are you a good cook?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e28) Are you a good artist?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e29) Are you a good listener?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e30) Are you a good public speaker?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e31) Are you a good babysitter?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e32) Are you a good mechanic?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e33) Are you a good diplomat?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e34) Are you a good employee?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e35) Are you a good dresser?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e36) Are you a good swimmer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e37) Are you a good skier?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e38) Are you a good lover?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e39) Are you a good musician?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e40) Are you a good comedian?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e41) Are you a good cleaner?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e42) Are you a good actor?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e43) Are you a good writer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e44) Have you ever been bungee jumping?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e45) Have you ever been canoeing/kayaking?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e46) What types of holidays do you prefer?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e47) Whats the furthest you've ever been on holiday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e48) What was your favourite holiday?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e49) Where would your dream holiday be?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e50) Can you tap dance?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e51) Whats your favourite zoo animal?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e52) Whats your favourite sport?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e53) Whats your favourite food?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e54) Whats your favourite pizza topping?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: Removed 46 of them ;p\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11.0500001907349px; line-height: 17.6800003051758px;\"\u003e","created_at":1428526658},{"id":174132,"author":"Kammeh","body":"Oh my, I'll answer this as soon as I get home, as it would be a pain to type this all on my phone, but don't worry, eventually I'll answer all of them, thanks for the questions ^-^","body_tagged":"Oh my, I'll answer this as soon as I get home, as it would be a pain to type this all on my phone, but don't worry, eventually I'll answer all of them, thanks for the questions ^-^","created_at":1428526945,"reply_to":174129},{"id":174133,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"Yey! :D","body_tagged":"Yey! :D","created_at":1428526969,"reply_to":174132},{"id":177700,"author":"Okiba","body":"Lol pyro dats a little too much m9 :/","body_tagged":"Lol pyro dats a little too much m9 :/","created_at":1429142704},{"id":177708,"author":"SavageAmericans","body":"Do you like dragons, grapes, and cool goggles? :)","body_tagged":"Do you like dragons, grapes, and cool goggles? :)","created_at":1429143463}]}